    <title>mYLastRSS</title>
    <link>https://sourceforge.net</link>
    <description><![CDATA[Files from mYLastRSS PHP class to parse several feeds at same time and give ordered result. Support RSS 0.9x/1.0/2.0, RDF, and Atom. Support some namespaced modules like Media RSS, iTunes, Dublin Core, and more... Include class to make RSS rewriting or filtering.]]></description>
